        "ai_gen_block_aca0487_y9HzKi": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_aca0487",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Frequently asked questions",
            "desktop_width_percent": 70,
            "section_padding": 0,
            "faq_1_question": "Can we choose custom colors to match our brand?",
            "faq_1_answer": "Yes. Every Rebel Nell mural-making experience is fully customizable to your brand, event theme, or company colors. Whether you're planning a corporate event, conference activation, or team building experience in Detroit, Grand Rapids, or nationwide, we design the mural to reflect your identity and message.",
            "faq_2_question": "What do you mean by \"remnants\"? Do you take the mural apart or can we keep it?",
            "faq_2_answer": "Great question — and one we get often. You always keep your mural. After your team building or corporate event experience, the mural is revealed as a complete piece that you can display in your office or space. If you choose, we can also transform portions of the mural into custom jewelry or keepsakes. These \"remnants\" allow your team or attendees to take a piece of the experience home — turning a shared moment into something you can hold, wear, and remember.",
            "faq_3_question": "Is this a mural on a wall?",
            "faq_3_answer": "No — this is not painted directly on a wall. Our mural-making experience is a mobile, self-contained installation designed for corporate events, conferences, and team building activities. It can be set up in your office, event venue, or conference space in Detroit, Grand Rapids, or anywhere in the U.S. or globally — with no permanent installation required.",
            "faq_4_question": "What is the mural reveal?",
            "faq_4_answer": "The mural reveal is one of the most powerful parts of the experience. Throughout the event, participants contribute to the mural without seeing the full picture. At a key moment, we remove the overlay to reveal the completed artwork — bringing together everyone's contributions into one unified piece. This creates a memorable, high-impact moment that's perfect for corporate events, conferences, and team building experiences.",
            "faq_5_question": "Do participants really get to take something home?",
            "faq_5_answer": "Yes — and this is what makes the experience truly unique. After your event, the mural is yours and will go home with you. Additionally, you can choose to transform the mural into custom keepsakes or jewelry, allowing each participant to take home a piece of the experience or ship it to you at a later date. It's a meaningful alternative to traditional corporate gifts and a powerful way to extend the impact of your event.",
            "faq_6_question": "How long does the experience take?",
            "faq_6_answer": "Most mural-making experiences range from 1 to 3 hours, making them easy to integrate into corporate events, conferences, networking events, and team building activities. We can customize timing based on your schedule and group size.",
            "faq_7_question": "What does facilitation include?",
            "faq_7_answer": "Our team fully facilitates the experience from start to finish. This includes setup, guidance during the activity, prompting participation, managing flow, and leading the mural reveal. Whether it's a corporate event, conference activation, or team building experience, we ensure everything runs smoothly so you can focus on your guests.",
            "faq_8_question": "Can you come to our space or do we need to come to you?",
            "faq_8_answer": "We do both. We can host your team building activity or corporate event at your office, conference venue, or event space in Detroit, Grand Rapids, or nationwide. We also offer experiences at our space in Eastern Market in Detroit for groups looking for an offsite location. The capacity in Eastern Market is 35. We also recommend the Congregation as another Detroit alternative location.",
            "faq_9_question": "Do you offer team building activities near me?",
            "faq_9_answer": "Yes. Rebel Nell provides mural-making experiences in Detroit, Grand Rapids, nationwide and globally. If you're searching for a team building activity near you, we can bring this experience directly to your office, venue, or event space.",
            "faq_10_question": "Do you host corporate events in Detroit, Grand Rapids and Elsewhere?",
            "faq_10_answer": "Yes. We regularly host corporate event experiences, team building activities, and conference activations in Detroit and Grand Rapids, and we also travel nationwide for events of all sizes.",
            "faq_11_question": "Can you travel for conferences and corporate events across the U.S.?",
            "faq_11_answer": "Absolutely. While we are based in Detroit and Grand Rapids, our team travels nationwide and globally to deliver mural-making experiences for conferences, corporate retreats, and large-scale activations.",
            "faq_12_question": "What makes this different from other team building activities?",
            "faq_12_answer": "Unlike traditional team building activities, this experience creates a lasting, physical outcome. Your team collaborates on a mural that is revealed in a powerful moment and can then be displayed or transformed into keepsakes — making it one of the most meaningful corporate event experiences available.",
            "faq_13_question": "Is this a good option for corporate retreats or offsite team building?",
            "faq_13_answer": "Yes. Our mural-making experience is a perfect fit for corporate retreats, offsite team building, and conference experiences in Detroit, Grand Rapids, or any destination. It creates a shared moment that strengthens connection, engagement, and memory.",
